{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年59歲的王祖賢憑藉電影《倩女幽魂》飾演「聶小倩」一角紅遍亞洲，榮升女神之列。她息影後定居加拿大，多年來生活低調。不過近年她在溫哥華開設</p><p>現年59歲的王祖賢憑藉電影《倩女幽魂》飾演「聶小倩」一角紅遍亞洲，榮升女神之列。她息影後定居加拿大，多年來生活低調。不過近年她在溫哥華開設艾灸館，進攻養生界，也開始高調起來，不時出席活動，她今年母親節在社交網分享訪談節目，罕揭家庭事。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250316/977917973794656256169403.jpeg/cbuPdLY5gzfHU1ZtniuLwkeoY-QvL8PatU2LxLVNi8Q\" alt=\"王祖賢的聶小倩成為經典。\"><figcaption>王祖賢的聶小倩成為經典。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250716/1022243309273223168842351.jpeg/VdbpFvtFef3JltVLGBJgyXYzSgH4V_Nhp4c-YKeHPmA\" alt=\"王祖賢有「最美聶小倩」之稱。（微博圖片）\"><figcaption>王祖賢有「最美聶小倩」之稱。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260402/1116320889995005952508396.jpeg/gS9Y_l6STTA2MIMR1jLHmFUsjcpDGkMsih2nwIodp8A\" alt=\"王祖賢現身溫哥華公園，在長椅上悼念張國榮。（小紅書＠王祖賢）\"><figcaption>王祖賢現身溫哥華公園，在長椅上悼念張國榮。（小紅書＠王祖賢）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260309/1107773253792960512941328.png/6N7s-FQXsfizkUFQPRPL1cFFroyCUIIPaou8DmqLvA4\" alt=\"王祖賢去川菜館食飯。（小紅書）\"><figcaption>王祖賢去川菜館食飯。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260309/1107757810642456576572310.jpeg/2L68SF206PhM8TKwdCpSGR5ul3fQZoa0HwoVdB8KFXQ\" alt=\"王祖賢。（小紅書截圖）\"><figcaption>王祖賢。（小紅書截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>王祖賢罕除口罩揭家庭事</p><p>王祖賢在節目中提到，他有兩個哥哥，但父母不太管他們，反而將期望都放在王祖賢身上。王祖賢又指媽媽很支持她發明星夢，「我媽很贊成明星夢，所以我從小就覺得，我是來買她的願望。」</p><p>王祖賢自小被媽媽到處帶去試鏡，「寧願一個禮拜菜錢都沒有，都要給我報名。」王祖賢因試鏡表現不理想，回家路上被媽媽責備及敲頭，「一路上一路（被媽媽）敲頭，敲到回家。」王祖賢笑言：「我命怎麼這麼苦！」王祖賢亦罕有除下口罩，快將「登六」的她氣質依然，仍然有當年絕世大美女的影子。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260511/1130597652522864640193674.png/kmbN8DG1DYS2stujMEDiIjO0BKICjK5b3WpZ291qWds\" alt=\"王祖賢提到自小被媽媽帶去試鏡。（抖音截圖）\"><figcaption>王祖賢提到自小被媽媽帶去試鏡。（抖音截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260511/1130597649049849856976534.png/YrMjfhoNqBk69CpSk8tfBS-j6T4n2Jb-yoRwL8qEcC8\" alt=\"王祖賢59歲氣質依然。（抖音截圖）\"><figcaption>王祖賢59歲氣質依然。（抖音截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260511/1130597645249679360962514.png/E_tWbjm_ErK0KauRGW2NfwFN3VKoGRn7q8Dq8KvA6vA\" alt=\"美。（抖音截圖）\"><figcaption>美。（抖音截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647619174731776971548.png/88Zhs7PUOIedCV-AoRvNjG7qvodBlXh2NNrUXTTa1F0\" alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647622148624384420176.png/t-RznnaDxJpp3aEJui4NqdH9HMRzUDnoI7g0OCO4NDg\" alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647626968141824107352.png/nmsefQoDf1Y6xphygcUQtzInHmyOAG6Pc7ia-HO4mvg\" alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647625949057024352694.png/_Vipt3-PLWUwhFvc_yUb76_NAMjeQlMg0tRG5tLURuY\" alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647624661143552917306.png/B6ML_dyH70pVtTFGffQ3KcWWc3SzE1q2DHRYYgx0WGI\" alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647629338054656905831.png/VyNDjNHAIP_GOu-5ncpoX3oHiInbvOf6_X1IJP19SCQ\" alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647897013948416356401.png/Ulf9gb9QE3Tky4oc-BoC1w53WAa65YavUdrG21Haxts\" alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647894484652032786594.png/yIl2BqsUW6WrNjelNg8BGL6LAL0AZDd_y6RPfsukT34\" alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647899450970112491863.png/ziTJNlcmSGVz2sdd8kB1-XL_aCg42IQepR_786Uf-_M\" alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-12T04:19:21.652519+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":770,"images":17,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}